2026-06-29 11:47:00,716 | AGENT | AIInnovation Agent answered: To design the AI components that meet the client's requirements, we will leverage our expertise in large language models (LLMs) and retrieval-augmented generation (RAG) capabilities. Our preferred sovereign model, Mistral 7B Instruct, will be fine-tuned using our established methods, such as LoRA or QLoRA, to adapt to the specific tone and format of administrative contents.

