Compliance with regulatory constraints will be guaranteed by adhering to the EU AI Act's limited risk requirements and ensuring that our solution respects the principles of data protection, as outlined in the GDPR. Our hosting infrastructure will be located within the European Union, and we will ensure that all data is protected in an appropriate manner, using encryption and anonymization when necessary.

By leveraging our expertise in AI research and development, LLMs, RAG, and explainability, we are confident that our solution will meet the client's requirements and provide a valuable tool for agents to improve their administrative activities.
